# Build context for the API images is the repo root; keep it lean.
# (Only core/ and the relevant docker/spar-apis/* Dockerfile are needed.)
# NOTE: `*.md` only matches the repo-root README-style files. Per-package
# README.md files under core/* are intentionally NOT matched (no `**/`),
# because each package's pyproject declares `readme = "README.md"`.
.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.DS_Store
*.md

# Unrelated to the API image builds
deployment/
